WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I know that you're close
to Blake Shelton.

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.535
-Oh, yes.
-Obviously, he's on "The Voice."

00:00:02.535 --> 00:00:04.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you reach out to him
for advice?

00:00:04.104 --> 00:00:05.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
Did you say,
"should I go do -- "

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:06.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sadly, I did.
-Yeah.

00:00:06.673 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know why.
-Yeah, that's weird.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:11.444 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I would recommend to never
reach out to him.

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:12.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:16.816
-No, he was -- when he heard --
it's funny, I think Blake knew

00:00:16.816 --> 00:00:21.021 align:start size:94% position:6%
about me, you know, 'cause
Blake's, you know, he's in TV.

00:00:21.021 --> 00:00:22.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
He hears all the whispers,
but --

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.224 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah. He's showbiz.
-I think he knew about me --

00:00:24.224 --> 00:00:26.493 align:start size:94% position:6%
-He -- yeah, Mr. Showbiz.
Mr. Sexiest Man Alive

00:00:26.493 --> 00:00:27.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
and all that.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.562 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How did that go over in
the country community

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
when Blake
was Sexiest Man Alive?

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:32.766 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We were quite perplexed.
-Yeah.

00:00:32.766 --> 00:00:34.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But we got over it.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:34.868 --> 00:00:36.469 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure, yeah.
-No, we --

00:00:36.469 --> 00:00:37.404 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ]
[ Applause ]

00:00:37.404 --> 00:00:40.573 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, he is a beautiful man.
-Yes, thank you.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah. From a distance.

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:43.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And --

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.078 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-When he's here, we make him

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:46.246 align:start size:94% position:6%
sit all the way at the end.
Yeah.

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:48.648
-Yeah, you, like, move
the couch. Oh, that's anchored!

00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.816 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, you're not moving
that thing.

00:00:49.816 --> 00:00:53.086 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
But, yeah, Blake did call me

00:00:53.086 --> 00:00:55.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, man, he was
really excited for me because,

00:00:55.789 --> 00:01:00.460
you know, in the country world,
man, we -- like, I love touring.

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:03.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love getting on the bus,
rolling down the road,

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:07.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
hanging with my buds,
going and playing shows.

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:11.905 align:start size:94% position:6%
And Blake was excited
because he -- he wanted to see

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:14.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
