sushi, bass sushi.

00:04:04.377 --> 00:04:05.311 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Gotcha.
So you just catch them --

00:04:05.311 --> 00:04:06.746
-So I people come --
yeah, we just catch them and --

00:04:06.746 --> 00:04:08.648
