our little pets, you know.

00:04:10.850 --> 00:04:13.119
-That's really nice. Yeah.
-But, you know, the boys

00:04:13.119 --> 00:04:16.389 align:start size:94% position:6%
get out there and, you know,
we've spent a lot of time

00:04:16.389 --> 00:04:18.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
growing these fish.
We're trying to catch, like --

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:21.995
Anyway, it requires a lot
of time, I've learned.

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:23.162 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Well, that's why you need

00:04:23.162 --> 00:04:25.365
