in the lake.

00:04:35.041 --> 00:04:38.678 align:start size:94% position:6%
His eyes are drying out.
Get him back in there." So --

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.713
-All right. All right.
Well, every part of that is more

00:04:40.713 --> 00:04:43.383 align:start size:94% position:6%
