-All right, thank you very much.

00:04:48.354 --> 00:04:50.023 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thanks for sticking around
and doing a song.

00:04:50.023 --> 00:04:51.658 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I can't wait.

